    [6670]={name="Panther Armor",quality=2,ilvl=27,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Den'. In Stonetalon Mountains.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="The Den",lore="The druids built the Talon Den on Stonetalon Peak, where they keep many powerful items. They devised a complex scheme to keep them from falling into the wrong hands."},
    [6678]={name="Band of Elven Grace",quality=2,ilvl=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Reception from Tyrande'. In Stonetalon Mountains.",zone="Stonetalon Mountains",questName="Reception from Tyrande",lore="I am sure Tyrande Whisperwind herself would like to thank you for taking part in this mission. It may not appear so on the surface, but what you've helped start could very well strengthen our foothold in the Stonetalon Mountains."},
    [6719]={name="Windborne Belt",quality=2,ilvl=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Highperch Venom'. In Dustwallow Marsh.",zone="Dustwallow Marsh",questName="Highperch Venom",lore="As you may know, wyverns are often tamed by orcs for use as mounts. But what is less known is that the venom of a wyvern, in some circles, is more valuable than the beast itself."},
    [6720]={name="Spirit Hunter Headdress",quality=2,ilvl=37,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Frostmaw'. In Thunder Bluff.",zone="Thunder Bluff",questName="Frostmaw",lore="it is now time for you to travel to far-off lands. You are ready. You now hunt Frostmaw, a yeti in the Alterac Mountains. He is elusive, his white coat blending into the snows of his mountain home."},
    [6745]={name="Swiftrunner Cape",quality=2,ilvl=33,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Alliance Relations' - pick it over the other choices. In Orgrimmar.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Alliance Relations",lore="The fight goes well. Perhaps the Warchief will allow us to return to our homes before the seasons change if we continue to make such great strides in our battle against the demons and their underlings."},
    [6784]={name="Braced Handguards",quality=2,ilvl=36,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Centaur Bounty' - pick it over the other choices. In Desolace.",zone="Desolace",questName="Centaur Bounty",lore="Now that you scared the centaur clans, it's time to bleed them. When traveling Desolace, hunt centaur. I don't care which clan you hunt. Just gather ears."},
